  "body": "There is something special about a home that gives family life room to spread out, both inside and out. At 28 Fairway Avenue, an expansive backyard, generous living spaces and a relaxed, easy-going feel create the kind of setting where children can play, friends can gather and summer days can stretch well into the evening.\r\n\r\nOwned and enjoyed by the same family for over 13 years, the home is now ready for its next chapter, with plenty of scope for new owners to bring their own ideas, style and personality to the spaces over time. There is a building report available to all buyers upon request.\r\n\r\nSet on an impressive 809sqm freehold section with an expansive, flat backyard, this four-bedroom, two-bathroom home combines generous outdoor space with comfortable, easy family living. Step through the light-filled conservatory entrance and into neutrally toned interiors that provides an easy starting point for the next family. There is plenty of scope here to introduce your own style, make further changes over time and add value to suit the way you want to live. Pitched ceilings, exposed beams and industrial-inspired lighting bring interest and character to the spaces, while plenty of natural light keeps the home feeling open and inviting.\r\n\r\nHere are some of the top features that await you:\r\n\r\n- Four bedrooms and two bathrooms provide comfortable accommodation for the whole family, with the spacious master privately positioned at the rear, complete with a walk-in wardrobe, ensuite with bath, heat pump, blackout and sunshade blinds, and direct access to the wrap around deck\r\n\r\n- Open-plan living forms the heart of the home, bringing together the living, kitchen and dining nook beneath characterful pitched ceilings, creating a bright and inviting space for everyday living and entertaining, with scope to adapt and personalise to suit your family\r\n- The parallel-style kitchen features a generous breakfast bar that keeps cooking wonderfully social, whether friends are gathered nearby while you entertain, children are doing homework, or the family is enjoying a relaxed meal together\r\n- Three additional bedrooms are tucked down their own hallway alongside the family bathroom with bath and shower, while a separate toilet and dedicated laundry bring welcome practicality to busy family life\r\n- The wraparound deck extends the living outdoors, leading to a paved BBQ area and an exceptionally level lawn - this is a backyard that is begging for backyard games, and where children and pets can play freely\r\n- A standalone double garage provides excellent parking and storage, while easy-care gardens allow you to enjoy the generous grounds without weekends being consumed by maintenance\r\n\r\nFairway Avenue is a highly desirable setting for families, with beautiful Red Beach and local shops close by and Silverdale Mall just a few minutes' drive away. The nearby Silverdale Park & Ride makes commuting easy, with convenient connections whether travelling north or south.\r\n\r\nHere, the best of classic Kiwi family living comes with the freedom to shape the home around your own tastes and needs. There's room to grow, room to gather and plenty of potential to make changes, add value and create a home that feels truly your own. Come and experience 28 Fairway Avenue for yourself, this could be the setting for your family's next chapter! Call Tyler Broughton or Kait Rutten for more information or come along to the weekends' open homes to see all that is on offer.",
